       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. GRADES.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 SCORE PIC 999 VALUE 87.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           EVALUATE TRUE
               WHEN SCORE >= 90 DISPLAY "GRADE A"
               WHEN SCORE >= 80 DISPLAY "GRADE B"
               WHEN SCORE >= 70 DISPLAY "GRADE C"
               WHEN OTHER       DISPLAY "GRADE F"
           END-EVALUATE
           STOP RUN.
